# personal finance workspace — never push to GitHub
# The whole directory is excluded, not just the raw data files: it holds the
# statements, balances, the review tooling and the context/plan notes, and the
# cost of leaking any of it is far higher than the cost of not versioning a
# helper script. Narrow this to `finances/tools/` later if you want the tooling
# tracked.
finances/
*.ofx
transactions_*.csv
finance-plan.md

# agent working docs: design specs and reviews, which quote personal context
# (finances, goals, relationships). Not part of the app, so they stay local.
plans/

